ine-height:1.55; color:#4B463E;">Add your first pieces. Clip them from anywhere with the Patina browser extension, or capture them in the field straight from your phone.</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" width="40" style="padding:16px 0 0;"><div class="chip" style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, 'Courier New', monospace; font-size:13px; font-weight:500; color:#B08A46; background:#FFFFFF; border:1px solid #E6DDCC; border-radius:50%; width:26px; height:26px; line-height:26px; text-align:center;">2</div></td><td valign="top" class="ink2" style="padding:16px 0 0 14px; font-family:'Hanken Grotesk', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:15px; line-height:1.55; color:#4B463E;">Choose a maker. Real people who already do the work — no marketplace noise, no listing fees.</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" width="40" style="padding:16px 0 0;"><div class="chip" style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, 'Courier New', monospace; font-size:13px; font-weight:500; color:#B08A46; background:#FFFFFF; border:1px solid #E6DDCC; border-radius:50%; width:26px; height:26px; line-height:26px; text-align:center;">3</div></td><td valign="top" class="ink2" style="padding:16px 0 0 14px; font-family:'Hanken Grotesk', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:15px; line-height:1.55; color:#4B463E;">Let your Capture Inbox learn. The more you file, the better Patina reads your taste.</td></tr></table><div style="height:28px; line-height:28px; font-size:0;">&nbsp;</div><table role="presentation" class="btn" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td bgcolor="#1F1B16" style="border-radius:7px;"><a href="{{dashboard_url}}" style="display:inline-block; padding:15px 32px; font-family:'Hanken Grotesk', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:15px; font-weight:600; line-height:1; letter-spacing:0.01em; background-color:#1F1B16; color:#F5F0E6; text-decoration:none; border:1px solid #1F1B16; border-radius:7px;">Set up your studio</a></td></tr></table><p class="ink2" style="margin:22px 0 0; font-family:'Fraunces', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif; font-size:16px; font-style:italic; color:#4B463E;">— The Patina team</p></td></tr></table>
