 Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:15px; font-weight:600; line-height:1; letter-spacing:0.01em; background-color:#B08A46; color:#F5F0E6; text-decoration:none; border:1px solid #8A6A30; border-radius:7px;">Get the iOS app</a></td></tr></table><div style="height:20px; line-height:20px; font-size:0;">&nbsp;</div><p style="margin:0; font-family:'Hanken Grotesk', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:14px;"><a href="{{changelog_url}}" style="color:#4E7A66; text-decoration:none; font-weight:500;">See everything that's new &rarr;</a></p></td></tr></table>
