ation:none; border:1px solid #8A6A30; border-radius:7px;">Accept invitation</a></td></tr></table><div style="height:20px; line-height:20px; font-size:0;">&nbsp;</div><p style="margin:0; font-family:'Hanken Grotesk', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:14px;"><a href="{{about_url}}" style="color:#4E7A66; text-decoration:none; font-weight:500;">First — what is Patina? &rarr;</a></p><div style="height:22px; line-height:22px; font-size:0;">&nbsp;</div><p class="ink3" style="margin:0 0 0px; font-family:'Hanken Grotesk', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:13px; line-height:1.6; color:#8C8578;">This invitation was sent to {{recipient_email}}. If you weren't expecting it, you can ignore it.</p></td></tr></table>
