/tr></table><table role="presentation" class="card" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="width:100%; background:#FFFFFF; border:1px solid #E6DDCC; border-radius:9px; margin:26px 0 0;"><tr><td style="padding:16px 20px;"><p class="ink3" style="margin:0 0 8px; font-family:'Hanken Grotesk', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:13px; line-height:1.5; color:#8C8578;">This invitation expires in 7 days. If the button doesn&#8217;t work, copy and paste this link into your browser:</p><p style="margin:0; font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, 'Courier New', monospace; font-size:12px; line-height:1.6; word-break:break-all;"><a href="{{action_link}}" style="color:#4E7A66; text-decoration:underline;">{{action_link}}</a></p></td></tr></table><p class="ink2" style="margin:22px 0 0; font-family:'Fraunces', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif; font-size:16px; font-style:italic; color:#4B463E;">— The Patina team</p></td></tr></table>
